---
// Greydemar Serrano - Hero Centrado, Fondo Estático Mejorado & Secciones
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  
  <title>Greydemar Serrano | Marketing & Project Manager</title>
  <meta name="title" content="Greydemar Serrano | Marketing & Project Manager">
  <meta name="description" content="Especialista en Growth Marketing, Creación de Contenido y Project Management.">

  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><rect width='100' height='100' rx='50' fill='%23FEF08A'/><text x='50%' y='62%' font-size='42' font-weight='900' font-family='sans-serif' fill='%230F172A' text-anchor='middle'>GS</text></svg>" />

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>

  <div class="global-fixed-bg">
    <svg class="sticker sticker-star" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <path d="M12 2L14.4 9.6H22L15.8 14.4L18.2 22L12 17.2L5.8 22L8.2 14.4L2 9.6H9.6L12 2Z" fill="#FEF08A" stroke="#0F172A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>
    
    <svg class="sticker sticker-plant" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <path d="M12 22C12 22 4 16 4 10C4 5.58172 7.58172 2 12 2C16.4183 2 20 5.58172 20 10C20 16 12 22 12 22Z" fill="#bbf7d0" stroke="#0F172A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M12 22V10" stroke="#0F172A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <path d="M12 16C10 14 8 13 8 13" stroke="#0F172A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <path d="M12 12C14 10 16 9 16 9" stroke="#0F172A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>

    <svg class="sticker sticker-sparkle" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <path d="M12 2L14 10L22 12L14 14L12 22L10 14L2 12L10 10L12 2Z" fill="#fbcfe8" stroke="#0F172A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <section class="hero-wrapper">
    <div class="hero-video-container">
      <video autoplay loop muted playsinline class="video-bg">
        <source src="/avila.webm" type="video/webm" />
      </video>
      <div class="avila-overlay"></div>
    </div>

    <header class="top-header">
      <div class="brand-centered">GREY SERRANO®</div>
      <div class="lang-switch">
        <button class="lang-btn active" onclick="setLanguage('es')">ES</button>
        <span class="lang-divider">|</span>
        <button class="lang-btn" onclick="setLanguage('en')">EN</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="hero-container">
      
      <div class="left-col">
        <div class="glass-profile-card" onclick="this.classList.toggle('active')">
          <div class="card-min-header">
            <img src="/grey.jpeg" alt="Greydemar Serrano" class="profile-thumb" />
            <div class="min-meta">
              <div class="status-line">
                <span class="green-dot"></span>
                <span class="status-text" data-es="En línea" data-en="Online">En línea</span>
              </div>
              <div class="name-group">
                <h2 class="min-name">GREYDEMAR SERRANO</h2>
                <span class="min-title" data-es="Especialista en Marketing Digital y Conversión Web" data-en="Digital Marketing & Web Conversion Specialist">
                  Especialista en Marketing Digital y Conversión Web
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="card-expand-content">
            <p class="expand-bio" 
               data-es="<strong>Marketing para atraer + Ventas para facturar + Web para escalar.</strong><br><br>No hago ruido, <strong>construyo ecosistemas rentables.</strong> Conecto contenido de alto impacto con sistemas de cierre comercial y plataformas ultrarrápidas.<br><br><strong>Mi objetivo:</strong> eliminar la fricción, posicionar tu autoridad y multiplicar tus conversiones." 
               data-en="<strong>Marketing to attract + Sales to invoice + Web to scale.</strong><br><br>I don't just make noise, <strong>I build profitable ecosystems.</strong> I connect high-impact content with commercial closing systems and ultra-fast platforms.<br><br><strong>My goal:</strong> eliminate friction, position your authority, and multiply your conversions.">
              <strong>Marketing para atraer + Ventas para facturar + Web para escalar.</strong><br><br>No hago ruido, <strong>construyo ecosistemas rentables.</strong> Conecto contenido de alto impacto con sistemas de cierre comercial y plataformas ultrarrápidas.<br><br><strong>Mi objetivo:</strong> eliminar la fricción, posicionar tu autoridad y multiplicar tus conversiones.
            </p>
            
            <div class="skills-grid">
              <span>Astro</span>
              <span>GitHub</span>
              <span>HTML5</span>
              <span>CSS3</span>
              <span>GA4</span>
              <span>Salesforce</span>
              <span>Zoho CRM</span>
              <span>Mailchimp</span>
              <span class="wide-skill">Creación de Contenido</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="quote-text">
          <span data-es="- Facturar no es casualidad. Depende de cómo te ven, cómo conectas y qué tan fácil les haces comprar." data-en="- Invoicing is no accident. It depends on how they see you, how you connect, and how easy you make it to buy.">
            - Facturar no es casualidad. Depende de cómo te ven, cómo conectas y qué tan fácil les haces comprar.
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-center-text">
        <h1 data-es="ESTRATEGIA QUE UNE MARKETING, VENTAS Y WEB" data-en="STRATEGY BRIDGING MARKETING, SALES & WEB">
          ESTRATEGIA QUE UNE MARKETING, VENTAS Y WEB
        </h1>
        <span class="floating-pill pill-pink">Growth Marketing</span>
        <span class="floating-pill pill-green">Project Manager</span>
        <span class="floating-pill pill-yellow">Visual Content</span>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-cases-card" onclick="this.classList.toggle('active')">
        <div class="cases-min-header">
          <span class="cases-title-text" data-es="Casos Destacados" data-en="Featured Cases">Casos Destacados</span>
          <span class="search-icon-wrapper">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
              <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="cases-expand-content">
          <ul class="quick-cases-list">
            <li><a href="#projects"><strong>YP Realty</strong><span>Growth +604%</span></a></li>
            <li><a href="#projects"><strong>Eurobuilding</strong><span>Comunicaciones</span></a></li>
            <li><a href="#projects"><strong>Impaktemos</strong><span>Coordinación</span></a></li>
            <li><a href="#projects"><strong>Editorial PanHouse</strong><span>Comunicaciones & VIP</span></a></li>
            <li><a href="#projects"><strong>Dislocal</strong><span>Project Coordinator</span></a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </section>


  <section id="about" class="about-section">
    <div class="about-container">
      
      <div class="sticky-note">
        <svg class="real-pin" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M12 10V22" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="5" fill="#ef4444" stroke="#b91c1c" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <circle cx="10.5" cy="5.5" r="1.5" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.6"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="note-text" data-es="About Me" data-en="About Me">About Me</span>
      </div>

      <div class="about-header">
        <h2 data-es="Hago un trabajo que las personas recuerdan." data-en="I do work that people remember.">
          Hago un trabajo que las personas recuerdan.
        </h2>
        <p class="about-subtitle" data-es="Diseño sitios web limpios, creo contenido atractivo y coordino cada detalle de tus proyectos. Como Project Manager, me encargo de organizar, dividir y ejecutar las tareas para quitarte un dolor de cabeza de encima y garantizar que todo salga de forma puntual." data-en="I design clean websites, create engaging content, and coordinate every detail of your projects. As a Project Manager, I organize, divide, and execute tasks to take the headache away and guarantee everything is delivered punctually.">
          Diseño sitios web limpios, creo contenido atractivo y coordino cada detalle de tus proyectos. Como Project Manager, me encargo de organizar, dividir y ejecutar las tareas para quitarte un dolor de cabeza de encima y garantizar que todo salga de forma puntual.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mac-window">
        <div class="mac-titlebar">
          <div class="mac-buttons">
            <span class="mac-dot red"></span>
            <span class="mac-dot yellow"></span>
            <span class="mac-dot green"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mac-content">
          <div class="bio-image-col">
            <img src="/memoji.png" alt="Memoji Greydemar" class="memoji-circle" />
          </div>
          <div class="bio-info-col">
            <p class="bio-intro" data-es="Soy <strong>Greydemar Serrano</strong>, comunicadora social con una visión estratégica orientada a resultados." data-en="I am <strong>Greydemar Serrano</strong>, a social communicator with a strategic, results-oriented vision.">
              Soy <strong>Greydemar Serrano</strong>, comunicadora social con una visión estratégica orientada a resultados.
            </p>
            <div class="stats-grid-about">
              <div class="stat-item">
                <h3>+4</h3><p data-es="Años de experiencia" data-en="Years of experience">Años de experiencia</p>
              </div>
              <div class="stat-item">
                <h3>+8</h3><p data-es="Proyectos coordinados" data-en="Projects coordinated">Proyectos coordinados</p>
              </div>
              <div class="stat-item">
                <h3>+5</h3><p data-es="Eventos de alto impacto" data-en="High-impact events">Eventos de alto impacto</p>
              </div>
              <div class="stat-item">
                <h3>+13</h3><p data-es="Marcas y organizaciones" data-en="Brands and organizations">Marcas y organizaciones</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="projects" class="projects-section">
    <div class="projects-container">
      
      <div class="sticky-note">
        <svg class="real-pin pin-blue" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M12 10V22" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="5" fill="#3b82f6" stroke="#1d4ed8" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <circle cx="10.5" cy="5.5" r="1.5" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.6"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="note-text" data-es="Casos" data-en="Cases">Casos</span>
      </div>

      <div class="projects-header">
        <h2 data-es="Proyectos que cuentan historias." data-en="Projects that tell stories.">
          Proyectos que cuentan historias.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="ios-windows-wrapper">
         </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <nav class="floating-dock">
    <ul class="dock-list">
      <li class="dock-item" data-tooltip="Sobre mí" data-tooltip-es="Sobre mí" data-tooltip-en="About Me">
        <a href="#about" class="dock-link"><img src="/notas.webp" class="mac-icon" alt="Notas"></a>
      </li>
      <li class="dock-item" data-tooltip="Casos" data-tooltip-es="Casos" data-tooltip-en="Cases">
        <a href="#projects" class="dock-link"><img src="/foto.png" class="mac-icon" alt="Fotos"></a>
      </li>
      <li class="dock-item" data-tooltip="Servicios" data-tooltip-es="Servicios" data-tooltip-en="Services">
        <a href="#services" class="dock-link"><img src="/finder icon.png" class="mac-icon" alt="Finder"></a>
      </li>
      <li class="dock-item" data-tooltip="Contacto" data-tooltip-es="Contacto" data-tooltip-en="Contact">
        <a href="mailto:greydemar@email.com" class="dock-link"><img src="/ICON MAIL.webp" class="mac-icon" alt="Mail"></a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <script is:inline>
    function setLanguage(lang) {
      document.querySelectorAll('.lang-btn').forEach(btn => btn.classList.remove('active'));
      event.target.classList.add('active');

      document.querySelectorAll('[data-es]').forEach(el => {
        el.innerHTML = el.getAttribute(`data-${lang}`);
      });

      document.querySelectorAll('[data-tooltip-es]').forEach(el => {
        el.setAttribute('data-tooltip', el.getAttribute(`data-tooltip-${lang}`));
      });
    }
  </script>

</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --navy-dark: #0f172a;
    --pastel-yellow: #fef08a;
    --pastel-pink: #fbcfe8;
    --pastel-green: #bbf7d0;
    
    --glass-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    --glass-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    color: var(--navy-dark);
    overflow-x: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* =========================================
     FONDO GLOBAL ESTÁTICO (Nuevos Stickers)
     ========================================= */
  .global-fixed-bg {
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;
    background-color: #f8fafc;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noiseFilter'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.65' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noiseFilter)' opacity='0.05'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    z-index: -999; 
  }
  
  .sticker { position: absolute; opacity: 0.7; }
  .sticker-star { top: 12%; right: 15%; transform: rotate(15deg); }
  .sticker-plant { bottom: 20%; left: 8%; transform: rotate(-10deg); opacity: 0.6; }
  .sticker-sparkle { top: 40%; right: 5%; transform: rotate(5deg); }

  /* =========================================
     SECCIÓN HERO 
     ========================================= */
  .hero-wrapper { position: relative; width: 100%; min-height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; }
  .hero-video-container { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; z-index: -1; }
  .video-bg { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .avila-overlay { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); }

  .top-header { position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 1300px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 32px; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: center; z-index: 10; }
  .brand-centered { position: absolute; top: 38px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #ffffff; text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); white-space: nowrap; }
  .lang-switch { background: var(--glass-bg); backdrop-filter: blur(16px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px); padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 30px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow); }
  .lang-btn { background: none; border: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; color: #334155; cursor: pointer; }
  .lang-btn.active { color: var(--navy-dark); font-weight: 900; }
  .lang-divider { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 12px; }

  /* HERO GRID (Ahora con align-items: center para alinear perfectamente en el medio) */
  .hero-container { 
    max-width: 1300px; width: 100%; margin: auto auto; padding: 20px 32px 100px; 
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr 260px; gap: 24px; 
    align-items: center; /* ESTO CENTRA TODO VERTICALMENTE */
    min-height: calc(100vh - 120px);
    position: relative; z-index: 10; 
  }
  
  /* Contenedor Izquierdo */
  .left-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; }

  .glass-profile-card { background: var(--glass-bg); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: 24px; padding: 16px 20px; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow); transition: all 0.4s; overflow: hidden; }
  .card-min-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
  .profile-thumb { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); transition: all 0.5s; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .glass-profile-card.active .profile-thumb { width: 85px; height: 85px; border-width: 3px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }
  .min-meta { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
  .status-line { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  @keyframes blink-green { 0% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0.3; } 100% { opacity: 1; } }
  .green-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #22c55e; border-radius: 50%; animation: blink-green 2.5s infinite; }
  .status-text { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; }
  .name-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
  .min-name { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.1; }
  .min-title { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; opacity: 0.65; }

  .card-expand-content { max-height: 0; opacity: 0; transition: all 0.5s; overflow: hidden; }
  .glass-profile-card.active .card-expand-content { max-height: 600px; opacity: 1; margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); }
  .expand-bio { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .expand-bio strong { font-weight: 900; color: #000; }
  .skills-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 8px; }
  .skills-grid span { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 800; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap; }
  .skills-grid .wide-skill { grid-column: span 2; }

  .quote-text { padding: 0 10px; }
  .quote-text span { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #ffffff; text-shadow: 0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); line-height: 1.4; display: block; }

  .hero-center-text { text-align: center; position: relative; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; }
  .hero-center-text h1 { font-size: 4.8rem; font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.98; letter-spacing: -0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 900px; color: #ffffff; text-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
  .floating-pill { position: absolute; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 30px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; white-space: nowrap; color: var(--navy-dark); pointer-events: none;}
  .pill-pink { background: var(--pastel-pink); top: -25px; right: 15px; transform: rotate(3deg); }
  .pill-green { background: var(--pastel-green); top: 52%; left: -25px; transform: rotate(-6deg); }
  .pill-yellow { background: var(--pastel-yellow); bottom: -25px; right: 40px; transform: rotate(2deg); }

  .glass-cases-card { background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); border-radius: 20px; padding: 14px 18px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.4s; overflow: hidden; }
  .cases-min-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .cases-title-text { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; }
  .search-icon-wrapper { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); border-radius: 50%; padding: 6px; display: flex; color: #ffffff; }
  .cases-expand-content { max-height: 0; opacity: 0; transition: all 0.5s; }
  .glass-cases-card.active .cases-expand-content { max-height: 350px; opacity: 1; margin-top: 14px; }
  .quick-cases-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .quick-cases-list a { text-decoration: none; color: #ffffff; display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-size: 13.5px; }
  .quick-cases-list strong { font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff;}
  .quick-cases-list span { font-size: 11px; color: #cbd5e1; margin-top: 2px;}

  /* =========================================
     SECCIÓN ABOUT ME Y PROYECTOS (ESTILOS COMPARTIDOS)
     ========================================= */
  .about-section, .projects-section {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 100px 32px 60px; 
    z-index: 5;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  
  .projects-section { padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 140px; }

  .about-container, .projects-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Sticky Note (Pegatina) con PIN Real SVG */
  .sticky-note {
    position: relative;
    background-color: var(--pastel-yellow);
    padding: 10px 18px 6px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    box-shadow: 2px 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    transform: rotate(-3deg);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .real-pin {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px; /* Clavado arriba */
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    filter: drop-shadow(0px 2px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.2));
  }
  .note-text { font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px; color: var(--navy-dark); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }

  /* Encabezado */
  .about-header, .projects-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px; }
  .about-header h2, .projects-header h2 { font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--navy-dark); margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .about-subtitle { font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; font-weight: 500; }

  /* Ventana Mac (Contenedor Info) */
  .mac-window { width: 100%; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); overflow: hidden; }
